      "title": "‘He is never leaving the house again’: mother reunites with son missing for six days in Victorian bushland",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/12/missing-teenager-walhalla-found-alive-australian-bush",
      "description": "<p>William, 17, was reported missing after straying from his camp near Walhalla in Victoria’s Gippsland region</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A teenager has shared an emotional reunion with his mother after being found alive following almost a week lost in dense bushland.</p><p>Police AirWing found William, 17, whose surname has not been shared, laying down in a creek near Walhalla, 185km east of Melbourne, in Victoria’s east on Thursday morning.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/12/missing-teenager-walhalla-found-alive-australian-bush\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-12T02:30:28"
    },
    {
      "title": "Human torso found in sofa in Sydney bushland prompts homicide investigation",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/12/human-torso-found-sydneys-lower-north-shore-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Police called to Lane Cove North on Wednesday after sofa found containing human torso believed to be that of adult man</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>New South Wales police have entered their second day searching for remains after a human torso was found in bushland on Sydney’s lower north shore.</p><p>Police were called to Lane Cove North about 2.30pm on Wednesday after recieving “a number of reports from members of the public” regarding a strong odour in the area, Supt Paul Devaney told media on Thursday morning.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/nov/12/human-torso-found-sydneys-lower-north-shore-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-11-12T01:27:01"
    },
